  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/91e8aec642532095687a81387090a8b079731048.png\" alt=\"project_babylon_materials_logo_big\"><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f7f9bfc707238d5f771b48e42c10b193ae105317.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/34ccc604bf424d08bb54e403c43a460ee3faaf3c.png\" alt=\"space\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\"><strong>Project Babylon - 是一個模組系列，致力於打造共同運作的 RPG 生態系統。<br>「素材」是本系列的<strong>核心</strong></span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/34ccc604bf424d08bb54e403c43a460ee3faaf3c.png\" alt=\"space\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">Project Babylon 素材提供：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>全新礦石</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>紅寶石礦石</strong> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/213e76e641f27028a98c8a293ba93efc344861cf.png\" alt=\"ruby_ore\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>魔法冰礦</strong> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dcd57304198afcbf9d28abc1e93867dff8cd8346.png\" alt=\"magical_ice_ore\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>全新素材</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>粉末</strong> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fd846c73186152ed52a3a55599d3c77fbc119775.png\" alt=\"dusts\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>金屬</strong> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f2a022a92686fda144cca283f0fff0f4b6eb6b64.png\" alt=\"metals\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>全新方塊</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>方塊</strong> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/3379472b5fb25ac162547e9ae2702eb2a8c3abe9.png\" alt=\"blocks\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>全新工具</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>鍛造錘</strong> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e6e78b60bb7ba6546fd68e7a7783a703dbdcf812.png\" alt=\"smith_hammers\"></p>\n<p><strong>鍛造錘合成範例</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c01dd13ccf4daf1a4e20ea2ff17279fedababf2.png\" alt=\"hammers_recipe_example\"></p>\n<p><strong>碗與研缽</strong> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/f0f12fe043da165af492991e1abf07d5f911c379.png\" alt=\"bowl_and_mortar\"></p>\n<p><strong>碗與研缽合成範例</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1f7cb7c5b3cae4ef2a4684e7294c336486c2890c.png\" alt=\"bowl_and_mortar_recipe_example\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>全新製作台 - 魔法灌注機</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">魔法灌注機是一款全新的製作台，使用「魔法粉末」讓你將素材組合，創造出全新的物品。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/edf0e76cbf92010b903d863d0ffa104187267058.png\" alt=\"magical_infuser\"></p>\n<p><strong>魔法灌注機合成範例</strong> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9d45b28c58ce739d3a5c20a60692147fe59ccc6f.png\" alt=\"magical_infuser_crafting_example\"><br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b412707b37e196f163b9b93962b0924b8af64820.png\"><br></span></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>歡迎查看由朋友製作的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod-rapier-moveset-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EpicFight Rapier Addon</a>，體驗更多模型與內容！<br>也請推薦由優秀團隊打造的 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/ascendra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ascendra Modpack</a> 與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/horyzen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Horyzen Modpack</a>。<br><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d9f50b27c02bef8209a8297e727ab44261ed4c08_0.webp\" width=\"409\" height=\"95\"><br></strong></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong><br><br></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>問題回報請前往此處：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f955784714264932362%252f1482312386139652248\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/channels/955784714264932362/1482312386139652248</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><strong>或此處：</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252fchannels%252f1481294346933375100%252f1481325691718078484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/channels/1481294346933375100/1481325691718078484</a></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>",
